{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/35e0e6fc0746f2ad48794ccec919338e.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=504 /></span>Bethesda Game Studios, the award-winning creators of Skyrim and Fallout 4, welcome you to Fallout 76. Twenty-five years after the bombs fell, you and your fellow Vault Dwellers\u2014chosen from the nation\u2019s best and brightest \u2013 emerge into post-nuclear America on Reclamation Day, 2102. Play solo or join together as you explore, quest, build, and triumph against the wasteland\u2019s greatest threats. Explore a vast wasteland, devastated by nuclear war, in this open-world multiplayer addition to the Fallout story. Experience the largest, most dynamic world ever created in the legendary Fallout universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/07957e77e5b67ea95feea6901068d526.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Immersive Questlines and Engaging Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of West Virginia by playing through an immersive main quest, starting from the moment you leave Vault 76. Befriend or betray new neighbors who have come to rebuild, and experience Appalachia through the eyes of its residents. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/9805cc4f15ffeeafde96bc2c47bec52c.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Seasons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each season and unlock free rewards like consumables, C.A.M.P. items and more by completing limited-time challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/5e8a0e31d0d6e9cf82792050bd0fef18.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Multiplayer Roleplaying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character with the S.P.E.C.I.A.L system and forge your own path and reputation in a new and untamed wasteland with hundreds of locations. Whether you journey alone or with friends, a new and unique Fallout adventure awaits.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/42d80fe9809bac12f591c30fdca5240d.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Mountain Splendorland </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story lives and breathes through the world of Fallout 76, which brings to life six distinct West Virginia regions. From the forests of Appalachia to the noxious crimson expanses of the Cranberry Bog, each area offers its own risks and rewards.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/40f263af56ce6d4a2759e97fe8ffdace.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>A New American Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the all-new Construction and Assembly Mobile Platform (C.A.M.P.) to build and craft anywhere in the world. Your C.A.M.P. will provide much-needed shelter, supplies, and safety. You can even set up shop to trade goods with other survivors. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/7469e1d9b00c328229281e678e9bf8be.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Fallout Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play unique adventures in Appalachia with Fallout Worlds, which is an evolving set of features that give players the capability to play Fallout 76 in unique ways with customizable settings.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2d9c2ba6f4bfccf96478be07d1382212500019b3.jpg","localized_name":"Reclamation Day!","name":"Reclamation Day!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/2d9c2ba6f4bfccf96478be07d1382212500019b3.jpg"},{"icon":"f6053aa91e9f19392e665cbfb9f5424ce5174c1d.jpg","localized_name":"First Contact","name":"First Contact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/f6053aa91e9f19392e665cbfb9f5424ce5174c1d.jpg"},{"icon":"b6059815c1b8eaa261c5a80e4b0b4d8ce0685f9b.jpg","localized_name":"Final Departure","name":"Final Departure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/b6059815c1b8eaa261c5a80e4b0b4d8ce0685f9b.jpg"},{"icon":"70ccd503358c207c65567236e2323066d8ceaaba.jpg","localized_name":"Second Helpings","name":"Second Helpings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/70ccd503358c207c65567236e2323066d8ceaaba.jpg"},{"icon":"6bb513a94f518f94dda842b1947319ae31adca63.jpg","localized_name":"Into the Fire","name":"Into the Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/6bb513a94f518f94dda842b1947319ae31adca63.jpg"},{"icon":"20902fb239cbc66406c77cd9e5f352d7c316bad1.jpg","localized_name":"Recruitment Blues","name":"Recruitment Blues","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/20902fb239cbc66406c77cd9e5f352d7c316bad1.jpg"},{"icon":"d11b8d64649fe7763a1296340ba04081dc9f8e15.jpg","localized_name":"Heart of the Enemy","name":"Heart of the Enemy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/d11b8d64649fe7763a1296340ba04081dc9f8e15.jpg"},{"icon":"605fb9db06d05d54bf591bdf68c0f3354394148b.jpg","localized_name":"Key to the Past","name":"Key to the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/605fb9db06d05d54bf591bdf68c0f3354394148b.jpg"},{"icon":"02e1df1662bab59e6aea2f6653dc79ef92353e2e.jpg","localized_name":"Coming to Fruition","name":"Coming to Fruition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/02e1df1662bab59e6aea2f6653dc79ef92353e2e.jpg"},{"icon":"8f4eeab51d62b3d1253219a0d8b3c8e560e17742.jpg","localized_name":"Bunker Buster","name":"Bunker Buster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1151340/8f4eeab51d62b3d1253219a0d8b3c8e560e17742.jpg"}],"total":72},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1151340?t=1772563212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/bd3e069260b0ca166ad929ea163bd1c1c0b85654/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772563212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/af7712a8b6fa295c9314f1295bf75028d20a2e25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772563212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/af7712a8b6fa295c9314f1295bf75028d20a2e25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772563212","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore\r\nDrug Reference\r\nIntense Violence\r\nStrong Language\r\nSuggestive Themes\r\nUse of Alcohol"},"detailed_description":"<h1>The Backwoods</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/0ae49c4ee65dd15035809610547ea15d.avif?t=1772563212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras_big/0ae49c4ee65dd15035809610547ea15d.avif?t=1772563212 width=1560 height=582 /></span>Dive into revitalized Events and Activities with rebalanced enemies, richer rewards and dangerous new three-star Uninvited Guests looking to crash your party. Earn new drops plus the chance to encounter Appalachia\u2019s first-ever four-star Cryptid: the elusive Bigfoot! Earn rewards in the latest Season, featuring the turn of Rip Daring as he faces off against otherworldly foes!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>Fallout 76: Mojave Bundle</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/5a92596323450479315ad28486f3faa6.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your NCR Power Armor and patrol the desert of Burning Springs with the Mojave Bundle: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger Power Armor Paint </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NCR Flag </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Vegas Neon Sign </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ad Victoriam (Super Sledge) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legion Legate Outfit </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Title Prefix \u2013 \u201cAdvictoriam\u201d </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Title Prefix &amp; Suffix \u2013 \u201cTribune\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallout 76 base game required, sold separately.</p></p><br><h1>Fallout 76: Mojave Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/cec5e8cdca60dab44d8b108383f9aa1f.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your NCR Power Armor and patrol the desert of Burning Springs with the Mojave Bundle: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger Power Armor Paint </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NCR Flag </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Vegas Neon Sign </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ad Victoriam (Super Sledge) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legion Legate Outfit </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Title Prefix \u2013 \u201cAdvictoriam\u201d </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Title Prefix &amp; Suffix \u2013 \u201cTribune\u201d</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/35e0e6fc0746f2ad48794ccec919338e.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=504 /></span>Bethesda Game Studios, the award-winning creators of Skyrim and Fallout 4, welcome you to Fallout 76. Twenty-five years after the bombs fell, you and your fellow Vault Dwellers\u2014chosen from the nation\u2019s best and brightest \u2013 emerge into post-nuclear America on Reclamation Day, 2102. Play solo or join together as you explore, quest, build, and triumph against the wasteland\u2019s greatest threats. Explore a vast wasteland, devastated by nuclear war, in this open-world multiplayer addition to the Fallout story. Experience the largest, most dynamic world ever created in the legendary Fallout universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/07957e77e5b67ea95feea6901068d526.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Immersive Questlines and Engaging Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of West Virginia by playing through an immersive main quest, starting from the moment you leave Vault 76. Befriend or betray new neighbors who have come to rebuild, and experience Appalachia through the eyes of its residents. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/9805cc4f15ffeeafde96bc2c47bec52c.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Seasons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through each season and unlock free rewards like consumables, C.A.M.P. items and more by completing limited-time challenges. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/5e8a0e31d0d6e9cf82792050bd0fef18.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Multiplayer Roleplaying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character with the S.P.E.C.I.A.L system and forge your own path and reputation in a new and untamed wasteland with hundreds of locations. Whether you journey alone or with friends, a new and unique Fallout adventure awaits.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/42d80fe9809bac12f591c30fdca5240d.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Mountain Splendorland </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story lives and breathes through the world of Fallout 76, which brings to life six distinct West Virginia regions. From the forests of Appalachia to the noxious crimson expanses of the Cranberry Bog, each area offers its own risks and rewards.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/40f263af56ce6d4a2759e97fe8ffdace.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>A New American Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the all-new Construction and Assembly Mobile Platform (C.A.M.P.) to build and craft anywhere in the world. Your C.A.M.P. will provide much-needed shelter, supplies, and safety. You can even set up shop to trade goods with other survivors. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/extras/7469e1d9b00c328229281e678e9bf8be.avif?t=1772563212\" width=1560 height=292 /></span>Fallout Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play unique adventures in Appalachia with Fallout Worlds, which is an evolving set of features that give players the capability to play Fallout 76 in unique ways with customizable settings.</p>","developers":["Bethesda Game Studios"],"dlc":[4250650,4141110],"ext_user_account_notice":"Bethesda.net (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151340/cd8a608831b087c3ad8b3b56fa8a8f14554ee9bd/header.jpg?t=1772563212","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Fallout\u00ae 76: Atlantic City - Boardwalk Paradise \u00a92023\u00a0ZeniMax Media Inc. Bethesda, Bethesda Softworks, Bethesda Game Studios, ZeniMax, Pip-Boy, Vault-Tec, Vault Boy, and related logos are registered trademarks or trademarks of ZeniMax Media Inc. in the U.S. and/or other countries. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPersistent broadband internet connection required. Acceptance of end user license agreement, Terms of Service, and Privacy Policy, and account registration required to play. Product may be discontinued, and content modified, disabled, suspended or removed, at any time. Product requires installation of application software. See Terms of Service, Privacy Policy and additional details at bethesda.net.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_